    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.1: # of GoB officials trained on contextualization and prioritization of SDGs including poverty-environment (disaggregated by sex)
1.1.2: Progress towards operationalization of Core SDGs Team (CST) to support in activities relating to the global goals
1.1.3: The extend of engagement in the preparation of 8th Five Year Plan
1.1.4: # of public planners coached and trained on integration of SDGs into national policy plans
1.2.1: Progress towards establishment and operationalization of National SDGs M&amp;E Platform, including poverty-environment 
1.2.2: # of officials coached and trained on SDGs monitoring and evaluation (disaggregated by sex)
1.2.3: # of Progress Report (or VNR) on SDG implementation, UNGA prepared regularly
1.2.4: # of stakeholder consultation workshops organized to receive feedback on SDG and 8th FYP progress reporting
1.2.5: Development of and an agreement on DRF for the 8th FYP through an inclusive process
1.3.1: # of knowledge products produced to enhance knowledge and capacity of the government policy makers to tackle emerging and challenging issues in SDGs achievement, including poverty-environment
1.3.2: # of consultations organized to receive feedback from wider stakeholders on knowledge products
2.1.1: # of training modules developed for enhancing capacity of local government officials on SDG localization
2.1.2: # of training workshops organized for developing capacity of local government officials for SDGs implementation
2.2.1: Progress towards operationalization of SDG Localization Platform to oversee, support and monitor localization of SDGs
2.2.2: The extend of piloting of SDGs Upazila Action Plan to localize SDGs in eight Upazilas
2.2.3: Progress of piloting of SDGs implementation monitored, reported and disseminated
2.3.1: # of research papers and case-studies on &#x2018;SDG Localization&#x2019; produced, including poverty-environment
2.3.2: # of consultation workshops organized to showcase the implementation status of SDGs localization
2.3.3: &#x2018;Ann</narrative>
    </description>
